  "steps": [
    "Add the paneer, onion, capsicum, curd, roasted besan, ginger-garlic paste, spices, kasuri methi and hot mustard oil to a bowl. Mix until everything is coated beautifully.",
    "Transfer everything to your Airfryer basket. For easier cleanup, use an Airfryer liner.",
    "Airfry at 180°C for 14 minutes, tossing it in between for even cooking.",
    "Finish with a squeeze of lemon juice and a sprinkle of chaat masala."
  ],
